        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cards of Fortune</strong> is a cooperative multiplayer game blending <strong>rogue-like</strong>, <strong>deckbuilding</strong>, <strong>bullet hell</strong>, and <strong>real-time strategy</strong>. Play as a cartomancer and venture into an ancient world filled with magicians, dragons, and forgotten deities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Room by room, you’ll face hordes of enemies or take part in unpredictable events. Each victory rewards you with a new spell card, strengthening your magical arsenal with more than <strong>30 unique spells</strong>. Sharpen your tactics—<strong>mana and health management</strong> are key to survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every <strong>10 rooms</strong>, a terrifying boss blocks your path. Fight alongside your allies all the way to the <strong>final battle against the divine forces of chaos</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed for cooperation, <i>Cards of Fortune</i> offers <strong>high replayability</strong> thanks to the wide variety of enemies (40+), room configurations, and custom challenges. It’s perfect for fun and strategic gaming sessions with friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✦ <strong>Platforms</strong>: Windows, Linux<br>✦ <strong>Languages</strong>: French, English<br>✦ <strong>Cooperative Multiplayer</strong><br>✦ <strong>Art direction inspired by Final Fantasy and Undertale</strong></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cards of Fortune</strong> is a cooperative multiplayer game blending <strong>rogue-like</strong>, <strong>deckbuilding</strong>, <strong>bullet hell</strong>, and <strong>real-time strategy</strong>. Play as a cartomancer and venture into an ancient world filled with magicians, dragons, and forgotten deities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Room by room, you’ll face hordes of enemies or take part in unpredictable events. Each victory rewards you with a new spell card, strengthening your magical arsenal with more than <strong>30 unique spells</strong>. Sharpen your tactics—<strong>mana and health management</strong> are key to survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every <strong>10 rooms</strong>, a terrifying boss blocks your path. Fight alongside your allies all the way to the <strong>final battle against the divine forces of chaos</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed for cooperation, <i>Cards of Fortune</i> offers <strong>high replayability</strong> thanks to the wide variety of enemies (40+), room configurations, and custom challenges. It’s perfect for fun and strategic gaming sessions with friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✦ <strong>Platforms</strong>: Windows, Linux<br>✦ <strong>Languages</strong>: French, English<br>✦ <strong>Cooperative Multiplayer</strong><br>✦ <strong>Art direction inspired by Final Fantasy and Undertale</strong></p>",
        "short_description": "A co-op rogue-like where strategy and chaos meet ! Battle monsters and gods in a magical universe, upgrade your deck, and survive hellish rooms in this tactical multiplayer bullet hell.",
